## Original Content
Apple unveils these new processors alongside an updated Mac Mini and Mac Studio.

## Summary
Apple has announced its new M5 Ultra and M6 chips, which are described as the most powerful chips ever, along with updated Mac Mini and Mac Studio computers. The introduction highlights a major advancement in Apple's chip technology for high-performance devices.

## Key Points
- Apple debuts M5 Ultra and M6 chips
- Chips are claimed to be the most powerful ever created by Apple
- New Mac Mini and Mac Studio models are released with these chips


